STEP 15 — FINAL VALIDATION

Before giving the final answer, check:

☐ All costs included
☐ Taxes handled correctly
☐ Shipping handled correctly
☐ Marketplace/payment fees included
☐ Returns/wastage considered
☐ Competitor pricing checked where necessary
☐ Margin calculated correctly
